    # KALA "I think soon I might need to... {i}find other solutions,{/i} if he doesn't do SOMETHING soon."
    KALA "조만간... {i}다른 해결책을 찾아야 할 것 같아,{/i} 그 자식이 곧 무슨 짓이라도 하지 않으면."

# game/data/world_interactions/hamun_spa_scenes.rpy:422
translate kr hamun_spa_tf_solo_1026a768:

    # KALA "How long is someone supposed to suffer?"
    KALA "사람이 언제까지 고통만 받아야 하는 거야?"

# game/data/world_interactions/hamun_spa_scenes.rpy:423
translate kr hamun_spa_tf_solo_762a8ea5:

    # KATIYA "Wait, you're thinking about having an affair?!"
    KATIYA "잠깐, 바람을 피울 생각이야?!"

# game/data/world_interactions/hamun_spa_scenes.rpy:424
translate kr hamun_spa_tf_solo_76fea7d9:

    # KALA "What else am I supposed to do at this point?"
    KALA "이 시점에서 내가 달리 뭘 할 수 있겠어?"

# game/data/world_interactions/hamun_spa_scenes.rpy:425
translate kr hamun_spa_tf_solo_6a4a701f:

    # KALA "Divorce is out of the question, our families would kill us..."
    KALA "이혼은 생각도 못 해, 양가에서 우릴 죽일 거야..."

# game/data/world_interactions/hamun_spa_scenes.rpy:426
translate kr hamun_spa_tf_solo_66bb0a60:

    # FAYE "What about you, Katiya?"
    FAYE "너는 어때, 카티야?"

# game/data/world_interactions/hamun_spa_scenes.rpy:427
translate kr hamun_spa_tf_solo_bffa51bb:

    # FAYE "Is there a special someone in your life?"
    FAYE "네 인생에 특별한 누군가 있어?"

# game/data/world_interactions/hamun_spa_scenes.rpy:428
translate kr hamun_spa_tf_solo_410ed763:

    # KATIYA "Haha, I am far too busy for such things."
    KATIYA "하하, 난 그런 걸로는 너무 바빠서."

# game/data/world_interactions/hamun_spa_scenes.rpy:429
translate kr hamun_spa_tf_solo_5f389d89:

    # FAYE "Booo.... BOOOO!"
    FAYE "우우.... 우우우!"

# game/data/world_interactions/hamun_spa_scenes.rpy:430
translate kr hamun_spa_tf_solo_0c43ccf2:

    # KALA "There must be one man in this city who catches your eye."
    KALA "이 도시에 네 눈길을 끄는 남자 하나쯤은 있겠지."

# game/data/world_interactions/hamun_spa_scenes.rpy:431
translate kr hamun_spa_tf_solo_6f15ab10:

    # KATIYA "W-Well..."
    KATIYA "그-그게..."

# game/data/world_interactions/hamun_spa_scenes.rpy:432
translate kr hamun_spa_tf_solo_54a356e5:

    # KATIYA "I did see one man recently."
    KATIYA "최근에 어떤 남자를 한 명 보긴 했어."

# game/data/world_interactions/hamun_spa_scenes.rpy:433
translate kr hamun_spa_tf_solo_635f61e7:

    # FAYE "Ooooh! Tell us everything!"
    FAYE "우우우! 전부 다 말해 봐!"

# game/data/world_interactions/hamun_spa_scenes.rpy:434
translate kr hamun_spa_tf_solo_82229c32:

    # KATIYA "Haha, there's not much to tell... He came into my store and he was just very handsome."
    KATIYA "하하, 별로 할 얘기가 없어... 그냥 가게에 들어왔는데 엄청 잘생긴 거야."

# game/data/world_interactions/hamun_spa_scenes.rpy:435
translate kr hamun_spa_tf_solo_ab1816c0:

    # KALA "And you're hoping he comes back?"
    KALA "그리고 그가 다시 오길 바라고 있는 거야?"

# game/data/world_interactions/hamun_spa_scenes.rpy:436
translate kr hamun_spa_tf_solo_a7dc8e2d:

    # KATIYA "I... {i}wouldn't say no to seeing him again.{/i}"
    KATIYA "나... {i}그를 다시 만나는 걸 마다하진 않을 거야.{/i}"

# game/data/world_interactions/hamun_spa_scenes.rpy:438
translate kr hamun_spa_tf_solo_8ab2beba:

    # "The women continued to giggle and chatter."
    "여자들은 계속 킥킥거리며 수다를 떨었다."

# game/data/world_interactions/hamun_spa_scenes.rpy:440
translate kr hamun_spa_tf_solo_3d01252f:

    # "Deciding I had seen enough, I turned to leave before anyone realized I'd been away for too long."
    "충분히 봤다고 판단하고, 나는 너무 오래 자리를 비운 걸 누군가 알아채기 전에 돌아서서 떠났다."

